{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这不是一条能回头的路  (This Is Not a Road With a Turnaround)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Summoned by Xingtian's chairwoman over his bold island survival proposal, Chun Yuqiao candidly weighs the opportunity cost of passing up safe foreign formats to pioneer original Chinese television. Listen to Chun Yuqiao and Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "直接说但是。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上周的报告看了吗？十二歌王收视率第一，超过第二名三个点，这是历史纪录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们的战略合作也签约了，现在正是我们有余力开发新项目的时候。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "比起资本风险，更关键的是机会成本。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在投入原创制作，就必须要放弃海外版权项目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "中国市场发展非常快，全世界的人都想挤进来，星天会是他们的第一选择。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可如果我们不跟他们合作，为了快速抢滩登陆，他们很有可能会跑到我们的竞争对手那边去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "到时候想回头就来不及了，所以这不是一条能回头的路。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你还用再问吗？你是我的老板，你了解我的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有把握让孤岛以同样的品质接棒十二歌王甚至超越。但是老板，留给你的时间不多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳总，十二歌王今天走台，但是惠美怎么都联系不上，已经迟到三个小时了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你有没有什么办法找她一下？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "直接说但是。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Skip straight to the word however.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上周的报告看了吗？十二歌王收视率第一，超过第二名三个点，这是历史纪录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you read last week's report? Twelve Singers ranked number one in ratings, beating second place by three full points — a historic record.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们的战略合作也签约了，现在正是我们有余力开发新项目的时候。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our overseas strategic partnership is signed too, so right now is the exact moment we have the strength to develop new projects.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "比起资本风险，更关键的是机会成本。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Compared with capital risk, the far bigger issue is opportunity cost.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在投入原创制作，就必须要放弃海外版权项目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Committing our team to original production right now means passing up licensed foreign formats.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "中国市场发展非常快，全世界的人都想挤进来，星天会是他们的第一选择。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The Chinese market is growing fast and everyone in the world wants in; naturally Xingtian is their first choice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可如果我们不跟他们合作，为了快速抢滩登陆，他们很有可能会跑到我们的竞争对手那边去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet if we turn them down, in their rush to gain a foothold they may run straight into the arms of our competitors.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "到时候想回头就来不及了，所以这不是一条能回头的路。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By then it will be too late to turn back — so this is a road with no turnaround.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你还用再问吗？你是我的老板，你了解我的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you even need to ask for my stance? You are my boss — you know who I am.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有把握让孤岛以同样的品质接棒十二歌王甚至超越。但是老板，留给你的时间不多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am confident Lonely Island will match or surpass Twelve Singers in quality — though boss, you don't have much time left to decide.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳总，十二歌王今天走台，但是惠美怎么都联系不上，已经迟到三个小时了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun, Twelve Singers has stage blocking today, except nobody can reach Huimei — she's already three hours late!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你有没有什么办法找她一下？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any way to track her down?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "直接说但是。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上周的报告看了吗？十二歌王收视率第一，超过第二名三个点，这是历史纪录。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们的战略合作也签约了，现在正是我们有余力开发新项目的时候。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "比起资本风险，更关键的是机会成本。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在投入原创制作，就必须要放弃海外版权项目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "中国市场发展非常快，全世界的人都想挤进来，星天会是他们的第一选择。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可如果我们不跟他们合作，为了快速抢滩登陆，他们很有可能会跑到我们的竞争对手那边去。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "到时候想回头就来不及了，所以这不是一条能回头的路。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你还用再问吗？你是我的老板，你了解我的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有把握让孤岛以同样的品质接棒十二歌王甚至超越。但是老板，留给你的时间不多。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳总，十二歌王今天走台，但是惠美怎么都联系不上，已经迟到三个小时了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你有没有什么办法找她一下？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Winning green light for early prep after vowing his original show will surpass Twelve Singers, Yuqiao is suddenly interrupted by Kaiwen with urgent news that Xin Huimei has vanished before stage rehearsal. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
